NovaTube
========

NovaTube is a fork of SmartTube (https://github.com/yuliskov/SmartTube)
by yuliskov, used under the terms of the MIT License (see LICENSE).

Modifications in this fork:
- Rebranded to NovaTube (package com.novatube.tv, new icon and accent color)
- UI restyled toward the official YouTube TV look
- In-app updater disabled (no longer checks SmartTube's GitHub releases)
- Donation / feedback links removed

All media-engine code (MediaServiceCore, SharedModules, ExoPlayer, Leanback)
is the original work of the SmartTube contributors. Thank you to yuliskov
and the SmartTube community.
